    "detailed_description": "<strong>This is the first game in the 'Sphere Game' franchise, also available for Xbox.</strong> <br>This 3D platformer delivers a unique, challenging, and visually stunning experience. Take control of a slightly weighted sphere and immerse yourself in a world full of challenges. Showcase your skills as you navigate through 15 engaging levels, designed with intriguing obstacles that will test your dexterity and agility.<br>Key features include realistic physics that provide an immersive gaming experience, ensuring that every movement of the sphere is authentic and dynamic. Explore three distinct difficulty levels - easy, hard, and impossible - to cater to all skill levels, from beginners to experienced players seeking an extreme challenge.",
